Hello <%= @payment.user.display_name %>,

<% if @payment.approved? -%>
Your payment of ₹<%= @payment.amount_inr %> is confirmed. Your <%= @payment.what %> is active until <%= l(@payment.paid_until, format: :long) %>.
<% else -%>
We could not confirm your payment of ₹<%= @payment.amount_inr %><%= " (transaction ID #{@payment.utr})" if @payment.utr %>.
Reason: <%= @payment.admin_note %>
If you did pay, reply to this email or send the correct transaction ID again.
<% end -%>

<%= @url %>
